config MP2_GPU_SCANOUT_HOLD_S
	int "Seconds the picture is held after the verdict line"
	default 60
	range 0 600
	help
	  After the PASS or FAIL line the probe keeps the scan-out running this
	  long before main() returns, so the runner's MP2_HOLD_S and the KVM
	  can see the picture. The board layer's lifetime
	  (CONFIG_YAKOGL_STM32MP2_LIFETIME_S) must cover it.

config MP2_GPU_SCANOUT_WAIT_MS
	int "Bound on the wait for each GPU fence, ms"
	default 1000
	range 1 10000
	help
	  gc_render_wait()'s bound, as gc_triangle's GC_TRIANGLE_WAIT_MS.
	  Past it the render service dumps the GPU's state and the run fails.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
